OL,3,AWoman with Ebola in Nigeria confirmed
OL,4,Aas wife of Swiss diplomat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ministry told the BBC that all 25
OL,7,Fstaff at its embassy in Nigeria were in
OL,8,Fgood health and did not need to
OL,9,Fisolate.
